  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio Frio Carbon Offset Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project development objective is to reduce greenhouse gas emissions from the wastewater treatment sector in Colombia through the modernization of the Rio Frio wastewater treatment plantcomma located in Giron (metropolitan area of Bucaramanga)comma Colombia. This modernization will result in abatements of Methane (CH4) and Nitrous Oxide (N20) emissions and in an improved effluent quality from the plant.</narrative>
  </description>
